en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingSwitching.description	Apply has started on this node. The node blocks new cache reads, captures the old snapshot for rollback, and switches to the prepared snapshot.
vi	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingSwitching.description	Apply đã bắt đầu trên node này. Node chặn request đọc cache mới, giữ snapshot cũ để rollback, rồi switch sang snapshot đã prepared.
en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingAcknowledged.title	Applied locally, waiting for barrier
vi	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingAcknowledged.title	Đã apply local, đang chờ barrier
en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingAcknowledged.description	The node has switched local cache and written acknowledged_at. It keeps the read gate until every snapshotted target also acknowledges or rollback is required.
vi	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.ApplyingAcknowledged.description	Node đã switch cache local và ghi acknowledged_at. Nó vẫn giữ read gate cho tới khi mọi target đã snapshot cũng acknowledge, hoặc phải rollback.
en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.Succeeded.title	Completed
