en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.RollbackPending.title	Rollback requested
vi	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.RollbackPending.title	Đang chờ rollback
en	ClusterCommandProgress$Step.RollbackPending.description	The command failed or aborted after some nodes had applied. This node must restore the previous snapshot.
